,{},"VATLY_WEBHOOK_SECRET",[820,838,839,840,843,844,847,848,851],{},"Pay through a ",[798,841,842],{"href":249},"hosted checkout",". Save the checkout\u002Forder IDs and\nconfirm signed ",[301,845,846],{},"checkout.paid"," and ",[301,849,850],{},"order.paid"," deliveries.",[820,853,854],{},"Check duplicate and failed deliveries. Delete or disable temporary endpoints\nbefore closing the tunnel; record any resources you create.",[297,856,857,860,861,864,865,460,868,864,871,864,874,877,878,881,882,885],{},[301,858,859],{},"vatly.testHelpers()"," exposes ",[301,862,863],{},"advanceRenewal",", ",[301,866,867],{},"forceRenewalPaid",[301,869,870],{},"forceRenewalFailed",[301,872,873],{},"forceOrderPaymentPaid",[301,875,876],{},"forceOrderPaymentFailed",", and the\nSDK-style ",[301,879,880],{},"fastForwardRenewal","\u002F",[301,883,884],{},"simulateOrderPayment",". These mutate account data.\nUse them only with permission and disposable test resources, not existing\nsubscriptions or orders just because the key is in test mode.",[790,887,889],{"id":888},"test-your-edge-runtime","Test your edge runtime",[297,891,892],{},"For edge hosts, also run your app in the local edge runtime with its storage adapter.\nNode tests alone do not check edge compatibility.",[297,894,895,896,902,903,534],{},"See the ",[798,897,901],{"href":898,"rel":899},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fguides\u002Ftesting",[900],"nofollow","testing guide"," and\n",[798,904,907],{"href":905,"rel":906},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference\u002Ftest-helpers",[900],"Test Helpers API reference",[909,910,911],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sT